 `game/vehicle/kart_model.gd`, `kart_geometry.gd` and `kart_slick.gdshader` author the unbranded refined kart and driver. The 208 prepared resources under `game/assets/vehicles/kart_refined_v1/` and five updated `racing_simple_v1/kart_shadow_*.res` are native bakes of these original surfaces. CompactFinish is reused from this project; no third-party model, texture, branding or runtime generation is introduced.
